  "summary": {
    "text": "Kimi K2 is an open-weight Mixture-of-Experts language model with 1 trillion total and 32 billion activated parameters, released on 2025-07-11 as Kimi-K2-Base and Kimi-K2-Instruct. Moonshot AI describes it as built for agentic tasks such as tool use and coding, pre-trained on 15.5T tokens with the MuonClip optimizer.",
